[CA]
RESOLUTION – Authorizing the Mayor and the City Clerk to sign a Final Plat for
Tyrrell Addition, 2nd Filing, a replat of a portion of Lot 9, Block 3, Replat of Westland
Subdivision; a portion of vacated and abandoned State Highway U.S. Hwy 30 and a portion of
Block 1, Husky Industrial Addition First Filing and Block 1, Tyrrell Addition being situated in a
